<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>IAmanda no RH</title>

  <meta property="og:title" content="Exporte tudo que a IA sabe sobre você">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Leve seu contexto, memórias e preferências para qualquer IA.">

  <style>

    *{
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      box-sizing:border-box;
      font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
    }

    body{
      background:#0f1117;
      color:#f5f5f5;
      padding:32px 20px 70px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .container{
      width:100%;
      max-width:720px;
    }

    .tag{
      text-align:center;
      color:#b388ff;
      letter-spacing:3px;
      font-size:13px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    h1{
      font-size:42px;
      line-height:1.1;
      margin-bottom:28px;
      text-align:center;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    h1 span{
      color:#7ef0c3;
    }

    .text{
      color:#d7d7d7;
      font-size:18px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .card{
      background:#181c25;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-radius:26px;
      padding:30px;
      margin:38px 0;
    }

    .label{
      color:#7ef0c3;
      font-size:13px;
      letter-spacing:2px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .prompt{
      white-space:pre-wrap;
      color:#f3f3f3;
      font-size:16px;
      line-height:1.9;
    }

    .copy-btn{
      width:100%;
      border:none;
      margin-top:26px;
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b388ff,#7ef0c3);
      color:#0f1117;
      font-size:16px;
      font-weight:700;
      cursor:pointer;
      transition:0.2s;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover{
      opacity:0.92;
    }

    .footer{
      margin-top:50px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .logo{
      width:240px;
      max-width:85%;
      opacity:0.95;
    }

    @media(max-width:640px){

      h1{
        font-size:32px;
      }

      .text{
        font-size:16px;
      }

      .card{
        padding:24px;
      }

      .logo{
        width:210px;
      }

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="tag">
      @iamandanorh
    </div>

    <h1>
      Exporte tudo que a IA
      <span>sabe sobre você</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text">
      Esse prompt ajuda a extrair memórias, preferências, contexto profissional e tudo que uma IA aprendeu sobre você ao longo do tempo.
    </p>

    <p class="text">
      Ideal para migrar contexto entre ferramentas, criar backups e começar uma nova IA sem perder histórico.
    </p>

    <div class="card">

      <div class="label">
        Prompt
      </div>

      <div class="prompt" id="promptText">Export all of my stored memories and any context you've learned about me from past conversations. Preserve my words verbatim where possible, especially for instructions and preferences.

Categories (output in this order):

Instructions: Rules I've explicitly asked you to follow going forward. Tone, format, style, "always do X", "never do Y", corrections to your behavior.

Identity: Name, location, education, family, relationships, personal interests.

Career: Current and past roles, companies, reporting structure, skill areas, freelance or consulting work.

Organizational context: Company description, size, culture, budget constraints, tools and platforms used regularly.

Projects: One entry per project. What it does, current status, key decisions already made, next steps if mentioned.

Internal vocabulary: Company-specific terms, process names, rituals, internal events, acronyms, and names of people that appear in our conversations with their relationship to me.

Personal brand: Brand name, tagline, active platforms, main offer, target audience, visual identity if mentioned, communication rules learned.

Preferences: Working style, opinions, and tastes that apply broadly.

Format:

Use section headers. One entry per line, oldest first. Format each line as:

[YYYY-MM-DD] - Entry content. Use [unknown] if no date.

Output:

Wrap everything in a single code block. After the block, state whether this is complete or if more remain.</div>

      <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyPrompt()">
        Copiar prompt
      </button>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">

      <img
        src="logo.png"
        alt="IAmanda no RH"
        class="logo"
      >

    </div>

  </div>

  <script>

    function copyPrompt(){

      const text = document.getElementById("promptText").innerText;

      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);

      const btn = document.querySelector(".copy-btn");

      btn.innerText = "Prompt copiado";

      setTimeout(() => {
        btn.innerText = "Copiar prompt";
      }, 2000);

    }

  </script>

</body>
</html>
